IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc6-builders`
IMPORT `ccc6-s150-1-consent`

-- Tests for s 150.1. Each expected value was decided from the text of the subsection before the run and is written beside the assertion.
-- Ages are in years. A charge is (section, subsection, complainant's age, accused's age).

GIVEN section IS A NUMBER, subsection IS A STRING, complainant IS A NUMBER, accused IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `s 150.1 charge`
`s 150.1 test charge` MEANS
    `s 150.1 charge` WITH
        `the offence charged` IS `Provision of the Code` OF section, subsection
        `the age of the complainant, in years` IS complainant
        `the age of the accused, in years` IS accused

GIVEN trust IS A BOOLEAN, dependency IS A BOOLEAN, exploitative IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 150.1 relationship of the accused to the complainant`
`s 150.1 test relationship` MEANS
    `s 150.1 relationship of the accused to the complainant` WITH
        `the accused is in a position of trust or authority towards the complainant` IS trust
        `the accused is a person with whom the complainant is in a relationship of dependency` IS dependency
        `the accused is in a relationship with the complainant that is exploitative of the complainant` IS exploitative

GIVEN `common-law partner` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN, `cohabiting under a year` IS A BOOLEAN, child IS A BOOLEAN, married IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 150.1 transitional facts`
`s 150.1 test transitional` MEANS
    `s 150.1 transitional facts` WITH
        `s 2 common-law partner: on the day on which subsection 150.1(2.2) came into force the accused was the complainant's common-law partner` IS `common-law partner`
        `on that day the accused had been cohabiting with the complainant in a conjugal relationship for a period of less than one year` IS `cohabiting under a year`
        `on that day the accused and the complainant had had, or were expecting to have, a child as a result of the relationship` IS child
        `immediately before the day on which subsection 150.1(2.3) came into force the accused was married to the complainant` IS married

`s 150.1 test none of the three` MEANS `s 150.1 test relationship` FALSE FALSE FALSE
`s 150.1 test nothing transitional` MEANS `s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE FALSE

§ `s 150.1(2) the exception for a complainant aged 12 or 13`
-- (charge, relationship). "less than two years older"; paragraph (b): none of the three relationships.
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 12 13) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- 1 year older: (a) and (b) met
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 12 13.5) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- 1.5 years older: still less than two
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 12 14) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- exactly two years older is not "less than two years older"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 152 "(1)" 13 13) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 152, same age
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 173 "(2)" 13 14) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- subsection 173(2)
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 271 "" 13 14) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 271
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 12 13) (`s 150.1 test relationship` TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- in a position of trust: (b) fails
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 12 13) (`s 150.1 test relationship` FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- relationship of dependency
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 12 13) (`s 150.1 test relationship` FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- exploitative relationship
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 11.99 12) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS NOTHING   -- complainant under 12: outside "12 years of age or more"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 13.99 14) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- 13.99 is still under 14
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 14 15) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS NOTHING   -- 14 is outside "under the age of 14 years": (2.1) speaks to it
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 12 or 13` (`s 150.1 test charge` 153 "(1)" 13 14) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS NOTHING   -- an offence the subsection does not name

§ `s 150.1(2.1) the exception for a complainant aged 14 or 15`
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.1) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 14 or 15` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 14 18) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- 4 years older
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.1) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 14 or 15` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 14 18.99) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- 4.99 years older
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.1) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 14 or 15` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 14 19) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- exactly five years older: not "less than five years older"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.1) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 14 or 15` (`s 150.1 test charge` 271 "" 15.5 17) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.1) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 14 or 15` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 14 16) (`s 150.1 test relationship` TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (b) fails
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.1) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 14 or 15` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 13.99 14) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS NOTHING   -- under 14: subsection (2) speaks to it
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.1) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 14 or 15` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 16 16) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS NOTHING   -- 16 is not "under the age of 16 years"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.1) it is a defence that the complainant consented, complainant aged 14 or 15` (`s 150.1 test charge` 280 "" 15 16) `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS NOTHING   -- offence not named

§ `s 150.1(2.2) the transitional exception for an accused five or more years older`
-- (charge, relationship, transitional facts)
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- common-law partner of the complainant
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- cohabiting under a year and a child
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- cohabiting under a year but no child had or expected
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a child but not cohabiting under a year
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) (`s 150.1 test relationship` TRUE FALSE FALSE) (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (a) met but (b): in a position of trust
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 14 19) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- exactly five years older is "five or more"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 14 18.99) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- 4.99 years older: the subsection speaks only to five or more
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 13 30) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- a 13-year-old complainant: (2.1)'s accused only
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- s 2 "common-law partner" not answered and no cohabiting limb: not covered
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` NOTHING TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the second limb of (a) holds whatever s 2 says
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.2) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being five or more years older` (`s 150.1 test charge` 153 "(1)" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- an offence (2.1) does not name

§ `s 150.1(2.3) the transitional exception for an accused who was married to the complainant`
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.3) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being married to the complainant` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.3) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being married to the complainant` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not married immediately before the day: the "if" fails
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.3) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being married to the complainant` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 13 25) (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- complainant 13: not "the accused referred to in subsection (2.1)"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(2.3) it is a defence that the complainant consented, the accused being married to the complainant` (`s 150.1 test charge` 280 "" 15 25) (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- offence not named

§ `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented`
-- (charge, relationship, transitional facts)
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 13 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- no exception: an adult against a 13-year-old
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 152 "(1)" 10 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 152
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 153 "(1)" 17 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- subsection 153(1): no age limit in (1) itself
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 153 "(2)" 17 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS NOTHING   -- 153(2) is not an offence the subsection names
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 160 "(3)" 12 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- subsection 160(3)
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 160 "(1)" 12 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS NOTHING   -- 160(1) is not named
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 173 "(2)" 12 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- subsection 173(2)
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 173 "(1)" 12 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS NOTHING   -- 173(1) is not named
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 271 "" 15 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 271 and a complainant under 16
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 272 "(1)" 15.99 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 272, just under 16
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 273 "" 15 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 273
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 271 "" 16 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS NOTHING   -- 271 and a complainant of 16: not "under the age of 16 years"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 280 "" 15 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS NOTHING   -- an offence the subsection does not name
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 13 14) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "Subject to subsections (2) to (2.2)": (2) applies
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 271 "" 15 17) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (2.1) applies
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (2.2) applies
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (2.2) does not apply: partner status answered "no"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- (2.2) undetermined (s 2 not answered): not turned into "no exception"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(1) it is not a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 13 14) (`s 150.1 test relationship` TRUE FALSE FALSE) `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (2) fails on (b): (1) applies

§ `s 150.1 whether it is a defence that the complainant consented (the five subsections gathered by hand)`
#ASSERT `s 150.1 whether it is a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 13 40) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS `s 150.1 consent is not a defence, by subsection (1)`
#ASSERT `s 150.1 whether it is a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 13 14) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS `s 150.1 consent is a defence, by subsection (2), (2.1), (2.2) or (2.3)`
#ASSERT `s 150.1 whether it is a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS `s 150.1 consent is a defence, by subsection (2), (2.1), (2.2) or (2.3)`
#ASSERT `s 150.1 whether it is a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS `s 150.1 subsection (1) says consent is not a defence and subsection (2.3) says it is, and the text does not say which prevails`
#ASSERT `s 150.1 whether it is a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 280 "" 15 25) `s 150.1 test none of the three` `s 150.1 test nothing transitional` EQUALS `s 150.1 section 150.1 does not say whether consent is a defence`
#ASSERT `s 150.1 whether it is a defence that the complainant consented` (`s 150.1 test charge` 151 "" 15 17) `s 150.1 test none of the three` (`s 150.1 test transitional` (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS `s 150.1 consent is a defence, by subsection (2), (2.1), (2.2) or (2.3)`   -- (2.1) and (2.3) both apply and (1) is displaced by (2.1): a defence

§ `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried unless in one of the three relationships`
-- (offence charged, the accused's age, relationship)
#ASSERT `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 151, "") 12 `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 152, "(1)") 13.99 `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- 13.99 is still "thirteen"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 173, "(2)") 13 `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 151, "") 12 (`s 150.1 test relationship` TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "unless": position of trust
#ASSERT `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 151, "") 12 (`s 150.1 test relationship` FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "unless": dependency
#ASSERT `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 151, "") 12 (`s 150.1 test relationship` FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "unless": exploitative
#ASSERT `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 151, "") 11.99 `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS NOTHING   -- not yet twelve
#ASSERT `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 151, "") 14 `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS NOTHING   -- fourteen: not "aged twelve or thirteen"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(3) no person aged twelve or thirteen shall be tried: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 271, "") 12 `s 150.1 test none of the three` EQUALS NOTHING   -- an offence the subsection does not name

§ `s 150.1(4) the belief that the complainant was 16 or more`
-- (offence charged, the accused believed, the accused took all reasonable steps)
#ASSERT `s 150.1(4) the belief that the complainant was 16 or more is not a defence: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 151, "") TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150.1(4) the belief that the complainant was 16 or more is not a defence: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 160, "(3)") TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150.1(4) the belief that the complainant was 16 or more is not a defence: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 273, "") TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150.1(4) the belief that the complainant was 16 or more is not a defence: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 151, "") TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "unless the accused took all reasonable steps"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(4) the belief that the complainant was 16 or more is not a defence: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 151, "") FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- the accused held no such belief: nothing to bar
#ASSERT `s 150.1(4) the belief that the complainant was 16 or more is not a defence: the bar applies` (`Provision of the Code` OF 153, "(1)") TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- 153(1) is in subsection (5)'s list, not (4)'s

