§ `s 150.1(6) a mistaken belief in the age of the complainant to invoke subsection (2) or (2.1)`
-- (the accused raises such a belief, the accused took all reasonable steps)
#ASSERT `s 150.1(6) the accused cannot raise a mistaken belief in the age of the complainant to invoke subsection (2) or (2.1): the bar applies` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150.1(6) the accused cannot raise a mistaken belief in the age of the complainant to invoke subsection (2) or (2.1): the bar applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "unless the accused took all reasonable steps"
#ASSERT `s 150.1(6) the accused cannot raise a mistaken belief in the age of the complainant to invoke subsection (2) or (2.1): the bar applies` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- no mistaken belief raised for subsection (2) or (2.1)
#ASSERT `s 150.1(6) the accused cannot raise a mistaken belief in the age of the complainant to invoke subsection (2) or (2.1): the bar applies` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
